title: Group Policy Object Modified (5136)
id: 4c406bf7-b29e-4f14-9427-3b9f817f9e18
status: experimental
description: Detects directory service changes to Group Policy objects (event 5136 on groupPolicyContainer/gPCMachineExtensionNames), which attackers abuse to push scripts, scheduled tasks, or settings domain-wide.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1484/001/
logsource:
  product: windows
  service: security
detection:
  selection:
    EventID: 5136
    ObjectClass:
      - 'groupPolicyContainer'
  condition: selection
  condition: selection
fields:
  - SubjectUserName
  - TargetUserName
  - IpAddress
falsepositives:
  - Legitimate GPO administration
level: high
tags:
  - attack.persistence
  - attack.t1484.001
